Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.90,0:00:12.03,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}I can't tell what'll come tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.03,0:00:15.45,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}This is different than making a sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.45,0:00:17.16,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}Something about it is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.16,0:00:20.79,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}And I don't think of it as some sort of forfeit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.79,0:00:24.00,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}So I just don't get why.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:27.46,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}I can't quite wrap my head around it,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.46,0:00:33.47,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)\fscx90}but your existence is now much more than just important to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.47,0:00:39.43,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}There's nothing in this world that doesn't come to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.31,0:00:43.77,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}I don't cry because I'm hurting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.77,0:00:46.44,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}They're the sweet, sweet drops of love!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.44,0:00:49.98,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}I want to go on dreaming forever, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.98,0:00:53.40,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}I want to try and be more gentle, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.40,0:00:56.82,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}If I can be with you, I'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.82,0:01:00.24,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}Girls are really strong, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.24,0:01:03.66,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}But sometimes, they can be really weak, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.66,0:01:09.96,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}Our wishes are happy, happy, happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.96,0:01:13.92,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}And our days will be just as happy!
